+<item>
+<title>Telegram macOS</title>
+<description>New:&lt;br&gt;• When a bot streams its reply, your message moves to the top and the answer grows below it, as on iOS&lt;br&gt;• Dictator's Telegram bot stays completely silent for anyone but you, and unpairing stops a running answer at once&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Improved:&lt;br&gt;• Long messages keep less memory in the chat list, reply headers and in-chat search&lt;br&gt;• A chat you leave is freed right away instead of after the next mouse move&lt;br&gt;• The agent no longer waits minutes on approvals you haven't answered: it carries on and tells you what still needs your OK&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fixed:&lt;br&gt;• The "…" at the end of shortened text takes the colour of the text next to it&lt;br&gt;• Recently used inline bots no longer list the same bot twice&lt;br&gt;</description>
+<pubDate>2026-19-11 11:37:15</pubDate>
